{"body":{"from":[{"$ref":"1M758Q8RACMR047"}],"opens":"Debts the readings of the ninth session found across the whole wiki, older than it: where the entry is named, said four ways; the names map said both let go and still held; an object model still listing an index where the store has a table; links by section number, as [§8], which the wiki itself says broke; Relations' never a copy beside a holon kept in each store that holds it; dense paragraphs in A mount is a call and Moving is a new address; What is open repeating Relations' own open list; the formats survey, Prose held by lone links and Why not an interior, perhaps to be sunk as history or sources; words used before they are given, as lexicon, buffer and field as a key. A whole-wiki round, the whole read and written again, not patched.","restsOn":[],"stands":"noted"},"id":"1M758Q8RACMR048","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000007"],"name":"The wiki read whole under the rule"}